exports[`audit rule descriptions > explains one rule: its texts, severity and options 1`] = `
"operation-id-present — Docs readiness · Warning
Operation without operationId

Why it matters: That fallback is derived from the method and the path, so every link a reader shares breaks the day the path is renamed.
How to fix: Give the operation a stable, unique operationId — a verb and a noun, in letters, digits and underscores (listPets).

Options:
  depth = 3 (1–9)
"
`;

